      "adaptation_decision": "Separate industry fixed-asset cycle, company operating stage and stock pricing stage. Require exactly eight evidence-bound cycle dimensions, five normalized stage probabilities, counter-evidence and observable migration signals. Demand, ASP, margin, capex, inventory, capacity, customer behavior, counter-evidence and migration evidence require official-grade support; market-reaction context may use secondary evidence. Output remains a SpecialistDelta and cannot create a target price, position or order."
